            </note>
            <note corresp="#d248-f3" n="3" xml:id="d248-f3-content">
                <p>The NSC met on January 19 to discuss the SALT II negotiations. The record of the meeting
                    is scheduled for publication in <ref target="frus1969-76v33"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations,</hi> 1969–1976, volume XXXIII,
                            SALT II, 1972–1979</ref>.</p>
            </note>
